# The stock audio HAL is the C2K build and always opens the CDMA voice
# channel /dev/ttySDIO0, polling it every few milliseconds when it cannot.
# This ROM does not run the C2K modem; a FIFO in place of the node keeps the
# HAL's reader blocked instead. GSM/WCDMA/LTE call audio does not use it.
on post-fs-data
    rm /dev/ttySDIO0
    exec - root audio -- /system/bin/mkfifo /dev/ttySDIO0
    chown audioserver audio /dev/ttySDIO0
    chmod 0660 /dev/ttySDIO0
